            "review_title": "Review at Mizuwari Saigon",
            "review_text": "Kyle Trần\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nMIZUWARI\nNov 2024 • Friends\nMizuwari is a cozy spot perfect for group gatherings. The bartenders excel at crafting custom drinks to match your preferences, and the vibrant atmosphere is made even better by the staff's friendliness and humor. A place worth returming to!\nInsider tip:\nMIZUWARI delivers an excellent atmosphere and outstanding service, but as a cocktail - focused establishment, it's food menu is limited.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 1, 2024",
