            "review_text": "Long\n1 contribution\n0\nWonderful night at Mizuwari\nApr 2024 • Friends\nI came here on Thursday which is live band day. The singers had a great performance on the stage with some popular Pop songs. At first they introduced me to visit outside where having beautiful view. I ordered 2 glass of cocktails, a classic and a signature one. Both of them are fantastic. After that, at 9pm the invited me to go inside to enjoy a live music night.\nFunny, friendly staffs and good service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 6, 2024",
