            "review_text": "Yến P\n2 contributions\n0\nVery good\nSep 2023 • Friends\nDELICIOUS, DELICIOUS, SMOOTH COCKTAIL\n\nI go to a lot of speakeasy bars in Saigon. But Mizuwari is one of those cocktail bars that has brought me back many times. It must be said that the space here is cute and cozy, and the cocktails here are of very high quality because almost all the ingredients come from Japan. The Bartenders were very enthusiastic and helped me choose cocktails.\n\nThe shop also has happy hour from 5pm-8pm every day. Priced from only 89k muk, you can get yourself a delicious glass of Highball!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten September 27, 2023",
