            "review_text": "Thi\nDoha, Qatar21 contributions\n0\nBest cocktail bar with Japanese style\nJul 2023 • Friends\nIf you don’t know where to go for cocktails and chill music in Saigon. Mizuwari is the best place for it. \nI had my best experience in here with amazing cocktails from the mixologist. They are know exactly what I want and everything in attention to the details. Last but not least the food by Japanese style so fresh and delicious.\nMust try at one when you have time to visit hcm city .\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 9, 2023",
